<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HCC Insurance 1997 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HCC Insurance 1997 EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it was raising its 1997 earnings estimate on HCC Insurance Holdings Inc to $1.36 a share from $1.33 a share, due to HCC's planned acquisition of North American Special Risks Inc group of companies.</p>
<p>--The estimate for 1996 remains at $1.10 a share.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
